# Stucco ceiling (solid, Stage 9 rows 0-6): cream c with w/o beads; the
# bottom tile of a column (nothing below) carries the cornice: a w/o
# moulding over an egg-and-dart band (c eggs with a w glint, O/o
# darts) and an O underside. No k: the outlined HUD reads over it.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_stuck
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
